+// (apps/web/src/pages/Capture.tsx:2979). Die normalen Anhang-/Bild-/Dokument-Uploads
+// (KnowledgeDetail.tsx:371 und :566, Capture.tsx:954 und :2432, AppendToArticleModal.tsx:87)
